DESCRIPTION >
    Immutable bootstrap membership index used to build bounded negative-lookup proofs.

SCHEMA >
    `baseline_id` String `json:$.baseline_id`,
    `tenant_id` String `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `index_kind` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.index_kind`,
    `bucket` UInt32 `json:$.bucket`,
    `member_key` String `json:$.member_key`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY baseline_id, tenant_id, index_kind, bucket, member_key
